<title>USA: Physio-Control names Martin chairman.</title>
<headline>Physio-Control names Martin chairman.</headline>
<dateline>REDMOND, Wash. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physio-Control International Corp said Friday that it has elected Richard Martin, formerly president and chief executive, to the positions of chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>As chairman, he replaces Stephen Pagliuca, principal at Bain Capital Inc, who will remain on the board.</p>
<p>Taking over as president and continuing as chief operating officer is Robert Guezuraga.</p>
